                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>Ambassador George V. Allen on May 29, 1953
                    and Anil K. Chanda, Deputy Minister for External Affairs, on June 24, 1953
                    signed and thereby brought into force an agreement establishing a United States
                    educational foundation in India. For the text, see TIAS No. 2881, printed in 4 UST
                    (pt. 2) 2288.</p>
            </div>
